   ```js
   const auth = await authenticateUser({
     client_id: "YOUR_CLIENT_ID",
     client_secret: "YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET",
     redirect_uri: "https://your-site.com/sc-callback",
     scope: "*"
   });
   // `auth` will contain an access token you can store in a cookie / localStorage
   ```

   After you have a token you can call privileged endpoints (e.g., `addSongToFavorites`) on behalf of the user.

---

## 4. Full example with custom UI

Below is a minimal, self‑contained HTML file that demonstrates:

* Embedding a track
* Custom play/pause/stop buttons
* A progress bar
